    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d978">

                <pb facs="0904" n="892" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg892"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24 Raw Materials/408: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gordon</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-11-10T17:00:00+00:20">November 10,
                            1939—5 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 10—2:18 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>263. Department’s 137, November 8, 4 p.m. Foreign Office has informed me that it
                    is telephoning Hart in London supporting our point of view.</p>
                <p>Repeated to London.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gordon</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
